{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3528","id":4725978019,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz888AAAABGbCzow","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3528","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3528.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3528.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3528","number":3528,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"util: parse \"0o\"-prefixed file modes in GetFileMode","user":{"login":"luochen1990","id":2309868,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDk4Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2309868?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luochen1990","html_url":"https://github.com/luochen1990","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luochen1990/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luochen1990/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luochen1990/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luochen1990/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luochen1990/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luochen1990/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luochen1990/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luochen1990/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luochen1990/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Description\n\nThe viper default for `unix_socket_permission` is `\"0o770\"`, but `GetFileMode`\nparses the value with `strconv.ParseUint` using base 8, which rejects the\nGo-style `0o` prefix — only base 0 accepts it. The parse fails and the function\nsilently falls back to `PermissionFallback` (`0700`), so with\n`unix_socket_permission` unset, the unix socket is created with mode `0700` and\nis never group-accessible, even though both the default and\n`config-example.yaml` (which spells the same value unprefixed, `\"0770\"`)\nclearly intend `0770`.\n\nThe existing tests in `cmd/headscale/headscale_test.go` load\n`config-example.yaml` (where the key is `\"0770\"`), so the default-value path\nhad no coverage and the mismatch went unnoticed.\n\nThis trims the `0o` prefix before parsing, so `\"0o770\"`, `\"770\"` and `\"0770\"`\nall parse as octal 770. `TestGetFileMode` covers the accepted spellings\n(`770`, `0770`, `0o770`, `0o700`) plus the invalid/empty fallback cases.\nVerified with `go test ./hscontrol/util/` and the config-loading tests in\n`cmd/headscale`.\n\nFound while diagnosing why a sandboxed root systemd service (empty\n`CapabilityBoundingSet`, so no `CAP_DAC_OVERRIDE`) running with the `headscale`\nsupplementary group got `permission denied` on `/run/headscale/headscale.sock`\n(`srwx------ headscale:headscale`) on a NixOS host running 0.29.3 with\n`unix_socket_permission` unset.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\n- [ ] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand (bug fix, open to contributions without discussion per CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] added unit tests\n- [ ] added integration tests (pure string-to-FileMode function; unit coverage is sufficient)\n- [x] updated documentation if needed (no doc change: the intended mode 0770 is unchanged)\n- [x] updated CHANGELOG.md\n","created_at":"2026-10-03T10:49:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T10:50:10Z","closed_at":"2026-10-03T10:50:10Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"dc15722dbb934dd042ecd8b399c68e3c9eaad3c8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/user